{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>From all the cattle and from all the beasts of the field</b>. Rabbi Yehoshua inferred from this verse that the serpent mates once in seven years (Bechorot 8a), and they investigated and found that this is indeed so (Genesis Rabbah ad loc.). For the midrashic interpretations of Scripture and their hints are received traditions, and within them lie deep secrets concerning the generations and all things, as I mentioned in my introduction:"], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {0 "The citation בכורות ח refers to tractate Bechorot, folio 8a (Babylonian Talmud)."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:23:37.151880869Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}